Dear Mr. Nazareth,

Adani Realty has four MahaRERA-registered Mumbai launches in Andheri West and=
 Bhandup West, priced from Rs 1.73 crore to Rs 6.91 crore. Enquiries already =
arrive through WhatsApp Business, toll-free callbacks and forms, while mixed =
buyer feedback on delays, pricing and transparency adds manual follow-up.

We help developers answer price, configuration, availability and RERA questio=
ns in minutes from approved documents, score leads and write follow-up tasks =
into the CRM. The first measurable target is median first response under 15 m=
inutes and a 1.5 point lift in qualified lead-to-site-visit conversion.

I would welcome a 30-minute walkthrough with your sales operations team, foll=
owed by a three-week read-only pilot on Adani Triumph before any buyer-facing=
 message.

I've attached a one-page summary.

[Your Name]

